> User hstuck (286891)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.241.240.68","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79995,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"85708c9a581e11a9db199378b2e5cf9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi everyone,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I joined this community back in June 2015 but someway somehow I wasn&#039;t able to post anything until now!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I have already got married (less than 2 weeks ago) and would love to provide any help to any bide looking for some guidance regarding wedding planning in the Mayan Riviera.&amp;nbsp; I will look into actually providing proper reviews to all my vendors (all of them were AMAZING!)&amp;nbsp; but if you have a question, shoot away and I will help if I can.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Main info - mixed wedding Canada &amp;amp; Mexico,&amp;nbsp; most of the people flying from Edmonton, AB and Monterrey Mexico.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wedding March 5, 2016&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Location: Blue Venado Beach Club&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Coordinator: Sofia Garcia - part of Blue Venado&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;DJ: Pro-DJ&#039;s Temo Piers&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Photographer: Jhankarlo Photography&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hair and Makeup: Sara Tamargo&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Transportation: Paradise Tours&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Flowers &amp;amp; centre pieces:&amp;nbsp; brought from home&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheers!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jazmin&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911970,"PostDate":1458162673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everyone,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I joined this community back in June 2015 but someway somehow I wasn't able to post anything until now!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have already got married (less than 2 weeks ago) and would love to provide any help to any bide looking for some guidance regarding wedding planning in the Mayan Riviera.\u00a0 I will look into actually providing proper reviews to all my vendors (all of them were AMAZING!)\u00a0 but if you have a question, shoot away and I will help if I can.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Main info - mixed wedding Canada & Mexico,\u00a0 most of the people flying from Edmonton, AB and Monterrey Mexico.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding March 5, 2016<\/p>\n<p>Location: Blue Venado Beach Club<\/p>\n<p>Coordinator: Sofia Garcia - part of Blue Venado<\/p>\n<p>DJ: Pro-DJ's Temo Piers<\/p>\n<p>Photographer: Jhankarlo Photography<\/p>\n<p>Hair and Makeup: Sara Tamargo<\/p>\n<p>Transportation: Paradise Tours<\/p>\n<p>Flowers & centre pieces:\u00a0 brought from home<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Cheers!<\/p>\n<p>Jazmin<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jsalazarmtz@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.239.125.187","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433702301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-283425.jpg?_r=1458157921","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":188,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsalazarmtz","Id":283425,"Name":"jsalazarmtz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.180.52.177","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79995,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"39efe1c29d6770ff56f6ff4bda597ecb","RawContent":"Congratulations!!! This site has provided soooo much useful information and I wished that a lot of it were up to date so after I get married in May I plan to do the same thing so I can help ease the minds of future destination wedding brides!","Attachments":[],"Id":1911974,"PostDate":1458169705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congratulations!!! This site has provided soooo much useful information and I wished that a lot of it were up to date so after I get married in May I plan to do the same thing so I can help ease the minds of future destination wedding brides!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lmf0408@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.54.64.217","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423579966,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Cablelove11","Id":282063,"Name":"Cablelove11","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.41.28","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79995,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23cd488a21308fa1d917526c909015da","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jsalazarmtz\"] Congrats! Blue Venado is a beautiful venue for a wedding. I know there have been a couple of brides here that have had their wedding there and the photos have been gorgeous.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Definitely post a review if you can. Future brides can always use the benefit of knowledge from past brides. Don&#039;t forget too, to do a review of your vendors and post them in the review section. That&#039;s something else brides will look at so the info is always useful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Congrats on being a Mrs! All the best!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911987,"PostDate":1458186696,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"283425\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/283425-jsalazarmtz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jsalazarmtz<\/span><\/a> Congrats! Blue Venado is a beautiful venue for a wedding. I know there have been a couple of brides here that have had their wedding there and the photos have been gorgeous.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Definitely post a review if you can. Future brides can always use the benefit of knowledge from past brides. Don't forget too, to do a review of your vendors and post them in the review section. That's something else brides will look at so the info is always useful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Congrats on being a Mrs! All the best!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.0.142.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79995,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c10a661db90a588d1f0b11c6dbf7f68d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your recent Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding, Jazmin!!! Really looking forward to hearing your reviews and seeing the photos....after all, a picture is \"worth a thousand words\"!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you a wonderful journey ahead in your lives going forward, and All the Best - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....here are some of our magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured at your wedding venue, taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq&#039;&gt;MTM Blog posts: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;of a recent &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding&#039;&gt;Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding Story Album&lt;\/a&gt;.....Enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1912001,"PostDate":1458246273,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your recent Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding, Jazmin!!! Really looking forward to hearing your reviews and seeing the photos....after all, a picture is \"worth a thousand words\"!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you a wonderful journey ahead in your lives going forward, and All the Best - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....here are some of our magical wedding moments that matter we've captured at your wedding venue, taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>MTM Blog posts: <\/a><\/p>\n<p>of a recent <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/#!blog\/lwgjq\/tag\/Blue-Venado-Beach-Club-Wedding' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Blue Venado Beach Club Wedding Story Album<\/a>.....Enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_2640c69c3da44c91938aa23cbec6a7d1.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_1d536773ee394fb3929e5818e2e189da.\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_3f1e6e3812f345d693b81bfe2e46da12.\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"131.137.245.208","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79995,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2932a1aa1722fe834a9d85d5f0fc26b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats - We are planning our wedding for April 2017 and are having some trouble decising on a resort.&amp;nbsp; We have decided it will have a little kids water park as we have a little one and so do many of our guests but there are just so many options - Grand Bahia Principe, Moon Palace or Sandos plus Punta Cana&#039;s Memories Splash.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We dont know where to start...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913568,"PostDate":1462916720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats - We are planning our wedding for April 2017 and are having some trouble decising on a resort.\u00a0 We have decided it will have a little kids water park as we have a little one and so do many of our guests but there are just so many options - Grand Bahia Principe, Moon Palace or Sandos plus Punta Cana's Memories Splash.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We dont know where to start...<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"adamphall@ymail.com","IpAddress":"131.137.245.206","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1462886136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286918.jpg?_r=1462901352","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AdamnJenn17","Id":286918,"Name":"AdamnJenn17","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":5,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
