need to do a room block and having trouble deciding which resort. I am looking at the Sheraton and Villa La Estancia. Sheraton is a little farther than I would like and heard it is hard to find lounge chairs. Estancia is great but their booking restrictions in their room block are very strict. Everyone must book and pay in full 3 months prior and no changes or cancellations within 3 months without a 1 nights penalty. Does anyone have any experience with these hotels? Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911638,"PostDate":1457382226,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi. I am getting married in Cabo this November at Hacienda Cocina Y Cantina. I need to do a room block and having trouble deciding which resort. I am looking at the Sheraton and Villa La Estancia. Sheraton is a little farther than I would like and heard it is hard to find lounge chairs. Estancia is great but their booking restrictions in their room block are very strict. Everyone must book and pay in full 3 months prior and no changes or cancellations within 3 months without a 1 nights penalty. Does anyone have any experience with these hotels? Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marisajs@earthlink.net","IpAddress":"65.213.192.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1457381779,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286434.jpg?_r=1458590090","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Marisajsingh","Id":286434,"Name":"Marisajsingh"